<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="EazyShortener is a fast, privacy-minded URL shortener with a clean web experience and developer-friendly API."
    />
    <title>EazyShortener — Short links without the clutter</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="shell nav-shell">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="EazyShortener home">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">E</span>
          <span>EazyShortener</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
          <a href="#features">Features</a>
          <a href="#developers">API</a>
          <a class="nav-cta" href="#membership">Sign Up</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="hero-glow hero-glow-left" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="hero-glow hero-glow-right" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="shell hero-shell">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">FAST · SECURE · PRIVATE</p>
            <h1 id="hero-title">Short links without the clutter.</h1>
            <p class="hero-lead">
              Turn long URLs into clean, dependable short links in seconds — with
              optional expiration and a developer-ready API when you need more.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button button-primary" href="#shorten">Shorten a URL</a>
              <a class="button button-light" href="#developers">Explore the API</a>
            </div>
            <p class="hero-note">No account required for guest shortening.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="shortener-card" id="shorten" aria-label="Guest shortener">
            <div class="card-kicker">Guest shortener</div>
            <h2>Paste a long URL</h2>
            <p>Create one short link at a time and optionally choose when it expires.</p>
            <form class="shortener-form" method="post" action="/shorten">
              <label for="original-url">Long URL</label>
              <div class="shortener-input-row">
                <input id="original-url" name="originalUrl" type="url" required maxlength="2048" placeholder="https://example.com/your/very/long/link" value="{{guestOriginalUrl}}" />
                <button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Shorten</button>
              </div>
              <label for="expiration">Expiration</label>
              <select id="expiration" name="expiration">
                <option value="never">Never</option>
                <option value="1h">1 hour</option>
                <option value="1d">1 day</option>
                <option value="7d">7 days</option>
                <option value="30d">30 days</option>
                <option value="custom">Custom date/time</option>
              </select>
              <label for="custom-expiration">Custom expiration</label>
              <input id="custom-expiration" name="customExpiration" type="datetime-local" />
              {{guestError}}
              {{guestResult}}
            </form>
            <div class="shortener-meta" aria-hidden="true">
              <span>1 URL</span>
              <span>Optional expiry</span>
              <span>Instant redirect</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="features" aria-labelledby="features-title">
        <div class="shell">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">BUILT FOR EVERYDAY USE</p>
            <h2 id="features-title">Small links. Serious engineering.</h2>
            <p>
              A focused shortener built around speed, privacy, and predictable behavior.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-grid">
            <article class="feature-card">
              <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              <h3>Fast redirects</h3>
              <p>Lean redirect handling keeps the path from short code to destination simple and quick.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
              <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>
              <h3>Secure by design</h3>
              <p>Cryptographically generated codes, bounded collision handling, and explicit validation rules.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
              <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">◌</span>
              <h3>Privacy minded</h3>
              <p>Guest shortening works without creating an account or attaching ownership identity.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section developer-section" id="developers" aria-labelledby="developers-title">
        <div class="shell split-layout">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">FOR DEVELOPERS</p>
            <h2 id="developers-title">An API when one link at a time is not enough.</h2>
            <p class="section-copy">
              Registered users can graduate from the guest experience to authenticated workflows,
              token access, and higher-throughput shortening without changing products.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link" href="#membership">Create your free account <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>

          <div class="code-card" aria-label="API example">
            <div class="code-card-bar">
              <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>
            <pre><code>POST /api/links
Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;

{
  "urls": [
    "https://example.com/launch"
  ]
}</code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section membership-section" id="membership" aria-labelledby="membership-title">
        <div class="shell membership-panel">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">WHEN YOU NEED MORE</p>
            <h2 id="membership-title">Shorten up to 10 URLs per API request.</h2>
            <p>
              Create a free account for authenticated link management, API tokens,
              optional custom aliases, and richer workflows.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="button button-primary button-wide" href="/register">Sign Up — Free</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="final-cta" aria-labelledby="final-cta-title">
        <div class="shell final-cta-inner">
          <p class="eyebrow">READY WHEN YOU ARE</p>
          <h2 id="final-cta-title">Make your next link easier to share.</h2>
          <p>Start as a guest now. Create an account only when you need more control.</p>
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#shorten">Shorten your first URL</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="shell footer-inner">
        <div class="brand footer-brand">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">E</span>
          <span>EazyShortener</span>
        </div>
        <p>Fast, focused URL shortening for the web and API.</p>
        <nav aria-label="Footer navigation">
          <a href="#features">Features</a>
          <a href="#developers">API</a>
          <a href="/health">Health</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
